# Execution Lock

> 此文件为机器可读契约，Executor 每页生成前必读。
> 与 design_spec.md 冲突时，以此文件为准。

## canvas
- viewBox: 0 0 1280 720
- format: PPT 16:9

## colors
- bg: #FFFFFF
- primary: #1A56DB
- accent: #F59E0B
- text: #111827
- text_secondary: #6B7280

## typography
- font_family: "Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif
- title: 36
- subtitle: 24
- body: 18
- caption: 14

## icons
- library: chunk-filled
- color: primary

## page_rhythm
- P01: anchor (封面)
- P02: anchor (目录)
- P03: content (内容页)
- P04: content (内容页)
- P_last: anchor (结束页)

